WEBVTT

00:00:08.740 --> 00:00:10.700
<v><b>I:</b></v> What’s your idea of happiness?

00:00:11.620 --> 00:00:13.220
<v><b>S:</b></v> That’s a difficult question.

00:00:13.361 --> 00:00:20.380
Um, my idea of happiness is probably relaxing with friends in my home,

00:00:21.060 --> 00:00:24.100
listening to nice music, with lovely food for everyone.

00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:30.300
<v><b>I:</b></v> What foreign languages do you speak?

00:00:30.739 --> 00:00:31.900
<v><b>T:</b></v> I speak French.

00:00:32.691 --> 00:00:34.020
<v><b>I:</b></v> How well do you speak it?

00:00:34.769 --> 00:00:37.500
<v><b>T:</b></v> Quite well. Not fluently, but well enough to get around.

00:00:44.380 --> 00:00:49.540
<v><b>I:</b></v> If you have a problem, who do you ask for advice, friends or family?

00:00:49.718 --> 00:00:53.660
<v><b>K:</b></v> When I have a problem, I usually ask close friends for advice.

00:00:54.716 --> 00:00:55.225
<v><b>I:</b></v> Why?

00:00:56.257 --> 00:00:58.300
<v><b>K:</b></v> My parents are a lot older than me,

00:00:58.540 --> 00:01:01.140
so their advice is really great for certain things,

00:01:01.150 --> 00:01:04.540
but most of the things I’m going through right now, my friends are pretty good.

00:01:09.180 --> 00:01:12.220
<v><b>I:</b></v> What advice would you give someone who can’t sleep at night?

00:01:12.980 --> 00:01:14.497
<v><b>J:</b></v> If someone couldn’t sleep at night,

00:01:14.497 --> 00:01:17.849
I’d usually advise them to do something like meditation,

00:01:17.849 --> 00:01:20.440
so some kind of breathing exercise which would calm them down, um,

00:01:20.440 --> 00:01:24.374
and also just to be in an environment where they feel comfortable and safe I guess,

00:01:24.374 --> 00:01:26.180
rather than in an environment that stresses them out,

00:01:26.291 --> 00:01:28.560
maybe keep their phone out of the bedroom, or something like that.

00:01:35.537 --> 00:01:38.408
<v><b>I:</b></v> Do you think the British are bad at learning languages?

00:01:39.451 --> 00:01:42.620
<v><b>A:</b></v> I think we do tend to be rather bad at learning languages.

00:01:43.180 --> 00:01:43.820
<v><b>I:</b></v> Why?

00:01:44.147 --> 00:01:50.582
<v><b>A:</b></v> I think we can be a bit lazy, because everybody else speaks English.